# Vendor tooling writes agent skills, hooks and telemetry state into the repo
# (`insta project create|link` installs 24 SKILL.md files plus a PostToolUse
# hook, and appends its own entries here). None of it is source, and none of it
# should reach a commit or an agent's context, so it is ignored wholesale.
# scripts/insta-setup.sh scrubs these after every CLI call.
.insta/
.insta-home/
